# ── 全仓库统一以 LF 为规范（存储与检出均为 LF）──
# text=auto : git 自动识别文本文件，并在入库时归一化为 LF
# eol=lf    : 检出到工作区时也强制使用 LF（覆盖 Windows 的 autocrlf 行为）
* text=auto eol=lf

# ── 二进制文件保持原样，不参与换行规范化 ──
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mkv binary
*.avi binary
*.mov binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
